manuscripts.colophon:
@reverse
@column 6

1'. [DUB.8.KAM@v ša₂ naq-ba i-mu]-ru
#tr.en: [Tablet VIII, ‘He who] saw [the Deep’.]
2'. [... b]a₃-ri₃
#tr.en: [Written and] checked [according to its original.]
#note: See @bib{RN117@738 fn. 5}: “This and the following line were incised on the tablet after the clay had hardened. The property label is Aššurbanipal colophon a = @bib{RN497@no. 317}.”
3'. [KUR {m}AN.ŠAR₂-DU₃-A MAN ŠU₂ MAN {kur}AN].ŠAR₂{ki}
$ end of side
#tr.en: [Palace of Aššurbanipal, king of the world, king of] Assyria.

