%n altabbiš-ma | mašak (|) l[abbim-ma || arap]pud | ṣēra
#note: See @bib{RN117@858}: “This line differs from its predecessor in the presence of coordinative -ma on the first verb, while SB VII 147 has this enclitic particle on the word that concludes the clause, @i{labbim-ma}. It is uncertain whether here one should restore @i{labbi} or @i{labbim-ma}.”
// cf. L I.4 SB "VII" 147

